<!DOCTYPE html>
<html><head><meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge"><meta charset="utf-8">
<title>PoStoreBaires — Beta 1.0</title>
<HTA:APPLICATION APPLICATIONNAME="PoStoreBaires" BORDER="thin" CAPTION="yes" SHOWINTASKBAR="yes" SINGLEINSTANCE="yes" SYSMENU="yes" WINDOWSTATE="maximize" SCROLL="yes">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/style.css">
<script src="assets/core.js" language="javascript"></script>
<script src="assets/app.js" language="javascript"></script>
</head><body>
<bgsound id="sound" loop="1">
<header><div class="right"><span id="network" class="badge"></span> <button onclick="help()">Ayuda</button> <button onclick="config()">⚙ Ajustes</button></div><span class="brand">▣ PoStoreBaires</span><span class="badge demo">1.0.0-beta.1 · MAQUETA</span><div id="identity" class="muted"></div></header>
<nav><button id="nav_caja" class="active" onclick="tab('caja')">Caja</button><button id="nav_arqueo" onclick="tab('arqueo')">Arqueo</button><button id="nav_insumos" onclick="tab('insumos')">Insumos</button><button onclick="openCustomer()">Pantalla del cliente</button></nav>
<main><section id="caja"><table class="layout"><tr><td class="maincol"><div class="panel"><h2>Nueva venta</h2><p class="muted">Escaneá un código o seleccioná un producto rápido.</p><input id="scan" style="width:70%" placeholder="Código de barras + Enter" onkeydown="if(event.keyCode===13)scan()"> <button class="primary" onclick="scan()">Agregar</button><p><small>Códigos de ejemplo: 779001 · 779002 · 779003 · 779004</small></p><table class="data"><thead><tr><th>Producto</th><th>Cantidad</th><th class="num">Subtotal</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="cartRows"></tbody></table><p><button class="danger" onclick="clearCart()">Vaciar venta</button> <button onclick="ticket()">Último ticket</button></p></div><div class="panel"><h3>Productos rápidos</h3><button onclick="add(0)">Alfajor</button> <button onclick="add(1)">Detergente</button> <button onclick="add(2)">Cigarrillos</button> <button onclick="add(3)">Agua</button></div></td><td class="sidecol"><div class="panel"><span id="saleState" class="badge"></span><h3 style="margin-top:24px">Resumen de venta</h3><div id="units" class="muted"></div><div id="total" class="total"></div><button class="primary full" onclick="pay()">Cobrar venta</button><p class="muted">Efectivo · Wallet · Débito · Crédito<br>Pagos combinados y cálculo de vuelto.</p></div><div class="panel"><h3 id="shop"></h3><p class="muted">QR y alias visibles durante la compra.</p><button class="full" onclick="openCustomer()">Abrir pantalla del cliente</button><button class="full" onclick="help()">Guía de configuración</button></div></td></tr></table></section>
<section id="arqueo" class="hidden"><div class="panel"><h2>Arqueo de caja</h2><p id="turnLabel" class="muted"></p><p>Saldo inicial: <b id="openAmount"></b> · Retiros: <b id="outAmount"></b></p><p>Efectivo esperado</p><div id="expected" class="total"></div><table class="data"><thead><tr><th>Medio</th><th class="num">Cobros netos del turno</th></tr></thead><tbody id="auditRows"></tbody></table><p><button onclick="withdraw()">Retirar efectivo</button> <button onclick="openTurn()">Abrir turno</button> <button class="primary" onclick="closeTurn()">Arqueo y cierre</button></p></div><div class="panel"><h3>Cierres de esta sesión</h3><table class="data"><thead><tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Caja</th><th>Cajero</th><th>Diferencia total</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="closureRows"></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="insumos" class="hidden"><div class="panel"><button class="primary right" onclick="productForm(-1)">+ Nuevo producto</button><h2>Insumos e inventario</h2><p class="muted">Productos, imágenes, precios y existencias.</p><input id="search" placeholder="Buscar nombre o código" style="width:45%" onkeyup="renderProducts()"> <select id="filter" onchange="renderProducts()"><option value="">Todas las categorías</option><option>Limpieza</option><option>Cigarrillos</option><option>Golosinas</option><option>Productos varios</option></select><table class="data"><thead><tr><th>Producto</th><th>Categoría</th><th>Precio</th><th>Stock</th><th>Acciones</th></tr></thead><tbody id="productRows"></tbody></table><p class="muted">Las existencias en naranja requieren reposición.</p></div></section></main>
<footer>PoStoreBaires · Copyright © 2026 Cristian Carroccio · GPL-3.0-only · Datos temporales · Red y perfiles simulados · Ticket no fiscal</footer>
<div id="overlay" class="hidden"><div class="modal"><h2 id="modalTitle"></h2><div id="modalBody"></div><div id="modalActions" class="actions"></div></div></div><div id="toast" class="hidden"></div>
</body></html>
